行商业酒会，到时候你会来吧？好几个同学都想见见你。”顾浅凝点点头：“知道了，问一下江影再说。”天知道那个季江影到底是做什么的，除了在医院见过几面，那时候她被前世今生的余印影像，神智不清。等清醒了，就再没见过他，听说是个上天入地无所不能的人物。整天在国外捞金，这边只有几个分公司。季家的主要产业还主要依靠季江然打理。所以颜如玉在她面前，腰板永远挺得更直一些。连看她的眼光也闪烁着轻蔑，尽管颜如玉在人前小心收敛，可顾浅凝不会看不出。两人不俱可比性，一个博学多才，一个不学无术，长相上不分伯仲，各俱风情，一综合顾浅凝端要矮下一头。顾浅凝和颜如玉的车一前一后开进季家别墅，下人上来帮着开门。颜如玉一转身看到她，笑起来：“浅凝，没想到我们一起到的。”依资料显示，两个人从幼儿园到高中一直是同学，现实中的一对好朋友。可顾浅凝在颜如玉的神色中看不出真正的友善。依稀含笑走过去：“是啊，好巧。”两人一起进去，颜如玉问她；“身体完全康复了吧？”“谢谢关心，已经没事了。”颜如玉抚着胸口：“当时在江然那里听说你出事了，差一点儿吓死我。还好你没事……”门应声打开，管家迎了出来。“大少奶奶，二少奶奶，老爷，太太和少爷们已经在里面等着了。”未婚媳妇来赴婆家的宴，自然都是盛装打扮。颜如玉是标准的杏花眼，眼角稍一勾勒就会无情无限。穿着紧身连衣裙，体态曼妙。一进来，笑容柔和：“爸，妈，让你们久等了。”她还带了礼物过来，是自己精心烘焙的甜点。礼貌又贤惠，这样周到。灯光下一比，顾浅凝便要逊色一些。以前她喜欢化大浓妆，钟爱烟熏妆，长辈面前会收敛一点儿，可是仍不喜欢素色。简心每次看她，总觉得不入流，不止一次在季铭忆跟前抱怨：“让江影娶顾浅凝那个疯丫头，真是糟蹋了我们江影。”季铭忆便说她妇人之仁，对于男人儿女情长算得了什么。哼声：“那就让江然娶。”简心更是连连摇头：“算了，我还舍不得如玉呢。”如今化了淡妆，倒有些认不出她。狐疑之后才了然，以前哪里见过她本来面目什么样。今天素衣素面的，清清冷冷立在那里，真的好似一树梨花。等简白夸过颜如玉贴心又懂事之后，她才得以插上话。“爸爸，妈妈，你们好。”眼风交错，终于看清她那个像雾像风又像雨的未婚夫季江影。黑长裤白衬衣，玉树临风，面如冠玉。一边闲散的转动手里的杯子，一边漫不经心的看过来。眼眸狭长而深邃，却是冷的。凝视她，宛如看着陌生人。事实上她跟他真的不熟络，也是今天下午她才接到季大少的电话，说晚上有晚宴的事。听筒里声音淡薄，只问她；“用不用过去接你？”她才说了句：“不用。”他便将电话切断了。简白已经在一边说话：“行了，人都到全了，我们开饭吧。”颜如玉笑滋滋的去掺简白。“妈，我跟你一起。”顾浅凝打进就开始头疼，这一会儿头疼的更厉害了。格斗，射击，哪怕智力游戏她都可以。最受不了的就是家庭伦理这一块，她实在很不擅长。打她有记忆不久开始，就被带到基地训练，没有家人，哪里知道家长理短什么样。要如何跟他们周旋。这跟卸甲归田有什么区别，要让她一个国际特工来这里完成一场豪门宅斗……抚上额角的手被人拉下来。是季江影。冷淡的斜睨她：“怎么？不喜欢？听说你不是最喜欢热闹，前几次见你可都是热情洋溢的。”就这样的氛围还会热情洋溢？不怕消化不良么？她淡笑，随口说；“那时候顾浅凝的脑子进水了。”顾浅凝听到季江影唇齿中溢出一声冷笑。顿了一步，便在想，这个季江影在顾浅凝的心里到底占什么位置？根据脑海中那些碎片残余，她将心里画出十个格子间。里面季江影和季江然的比重都很大，但季江影明显更多一些。顾浅凝除了搞不明白他长什么模样，却仿佛很了解他的性情，薄凉，冷血，对她趋之若鹜。“怎么还不走？反应可以慢，但态度要积极。”季江然游刃有余的勾了勾她的小手指，先往餐厅里去了。一顿饭吃下来四平八稳，都是家境良好的世家子，席间几乎没有人说话。饭罢几个小辈簇拥季家二老到厅里坐，下人已经把水果和茶水端上来。顾浅凝和季江影坐一边，颜如玉和季江然坐到另一边。简白最先说话；“我们有一个打算，考虑到你们的年纪都不小了，不如一起举行婚礼，分人的排场不会小。想着跟你们商量一下。”话落没有人说话。季铭忆问季江影：“你没什么意见吧？”季江影懒洋洋的说：“我是没意见，只是害怕没时间。”这跟没意见有什么区别？顾浅凝在心里冷哼。季铭忆已经看过来：“那浅凝怎么看？你回去也跟家人商量一下，先有这么个想法，改天双方家长再一起吃一顿饭商量一下。如果江影真的抽不出时间，你们的婚事只能往后推。”顾浅凝抬眸：“爸爸，那就往后推一推吧，结婚不是一两天的事。等季大……江影什么时候有时间再商议这个事不迟，我不着急。”他这一番话简直让人惊掉下巴，连季江影都要侧首看过来。这个女人自打出过那起事故，就像变了一个人。谁不知道顾浅凝这根枝攀得有多迫切，这一刻反倒矜持起来了。倒像是在耍花样，不过她没那样的脑子，是也是背后有高人指点。季铭忆也不好说什么，只道：“那你们的就再商量。”又转首问季江然；“江然，你们呢？”这一对好说话。“我没意见。”颜如玉乖巧的附合：“是啊，家长安排就好，我们没有意见。”男才女貌，倒像是真的情投意合。正式商量得差不多了，闲聊了一会儿其他，季铭忆有些累了，简白扶着他上楼休息。走前告诉顾浅凝和颜如玉：“你们两个上去坐坐吧，跟江影和江然聊聊天。”等两位老人一走，顾浅凝站起身：“时间不早了，我走了。”季江影飘飘的唤她：“上去坐一坐吧，戏要硬演就没意思了。”走过场也得有个样子，毕竟在外人看来他们是门当户对的未婚夫妇。顾浅凝可不是在跟他玩顾擒欲纵的把戏，拿上包。“改天吧，季大少才从外地回来一定很辛苦，不打扰你休息了。”跟颜玉如道过别，看了一眼似笑非笑的季江然，率先离场。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongshengzhihaomenhannu/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The best spring breeze (002) Ji Family Dinner Fang Xinzhong saw that there seemed to be a coldness in Gu Qian's eyes. He sat upright and said, \"I heard that you are now Mr. Ji's fiancée. I haven't had time to congratulate you yet. Mr. Ji's company is going to hold a business reception. Will you come then? Several days ago All the classmates want to meet you.\" Gu Qianning nodded: \"I know, let's ask Jiang Ying.\" God knows what Ji Jiangying does. Except for meeting her a few times in the hospital, she was left unconscious by the remnants of her past and present lives. When I woke up, I never saw him again. I heard that he was an omnipotent figure in heaven and earth. I spend my whole day making money abroad, and there are only a few branches here. The main industry of the Ji family mainly depends on Ji Jiangran. Therefore, Yan Ruyu's back is always straighter in front of her. Even the look in her eyes flashed with contempt. Although Yan Ruyu was careful to restrain herself in front of others, Gu Qianning couldn't help but notice it. The two of them are not comparable, one is knowledgeable and the other is uneducated. They are about the same appearance, and both have their own style. On the whole, Gu Qianning is a head shorter. Gu Qianning and Yan Ruyu's cars drove into the Ji family villa one after another, and the servants came up to help open the door. Yan Ruyu turned around and saw her and smiled: \"Qian Ning, I didn't expect us to arrive together.\" According to the information, the two have been classmates from kindergarten to high school, and are a pair of good friends in reality. But Gu Qianning couldn't see any real friendliness in Yan Ruyu's expression. She walked over with a faint smile: \"Yeah, what a coincidence.\" The two of them went in together, and Yan Ruyu asked her; \"Have you fully recovered?\" \"Thank you for your concern, you are fine now.\" Yan Ruyu stroked her chest: \"I heard at Jiang Ran's place that something had happened to you, and I almost scared me to death. Fortunately, you are fine...\" The door opened and the housekeeper came out. \"The eldest mistress, the second mistress, the master, the wife and the young masters are already waiting inside.\" When the unmarried daughter-in-law came to attend the banquet of her husband's family, she naturally dressed up. Yan Ruyu has standard apricot blossom eyes, and the corners of her eyes will become ruthless and infinite. Wearing a tight dress, she has a graceful figure. As soon as she came in, she smiled softly: \"Dad, Mom, I kept you waiting for a long time.\" She also brought a gift, which was a dessert carefully baked by herself. Polite and virtuous, so thoughtful. Under the lighting, Gu Qianning was inferior. In the past, she liked to wear heavy makeup and smoky makeup. She would be a little more restrained in front of her elders, but she still didn't like plain colors. Every time Jian Xin looked at her, she always felt inferior. She complained to Ji Mingyi more than once: \"Let Jiang Ying marry that crazy girl Gu Qianning, we are really ruining our Jiang Ying.\" Ji Mingyi said that her kindness as a woman meant nothing to a man's love for his children. Hum: \"Then let Jiang Ran marry.\" Jian Xin shook her head repeatedly: \"Forget it, I still can't bear to part with Ruyu.\" Now that she was wearing light makeup, she was a little unrecognizable. After being suspicious, I realized that I had seen her true face before. Today, wearing plain clothes and face, standing there cold and cold, it really looks like a pear tree. After Jian Bai praised Yan Ruyu for being considerate and sensible, she was able to intervene. \"Dad, mom, hello.\" Eyes crossed, she finally saw her fiancé Ji Jiangying clearly, who looked like fog, wind and rain. Wearing black trousers and a white shirt, the jade tree is facing the wind, and the face is like a crown jade. While turning the cup in his hand idly, he looked over casually. The eyes are long, narrow and deep, but cold. Staring at her was like looking at a stranger. In fact, she wasn't really familiar with him, and it was only this afternoon that she received a call from Young Master Ji, telling him that there was a dinner going on that evening. The voice on the receiver was weak, and he only asked her, \"Do I need to pick you up?\" She said, \"No,\" and he cut off the call. Jian Bai was already talking to the side: \"Okay, everyone is here, let's have dinner.\" Yan Ruyu smiled happily and went to mix Jian Bai's food. \"Mom, I'm with you.\" Gu Qianning started to have a headache as soon as she called in, and now her headache became even worse. She can fight, shoot, even mind games. What she couldn't stand the most was family ethics, which she was really bad at. Not long after she had memories, she was taken to the base for training. Without her family, she didn't know what parents were like. How to deal with them. What's the difference between this and returning home? She, an international agent, was asked to come here to complete a wealthy family fight... The hand on her forehead was pulled down. It's Ji Jiangying. He glanced at her coldly: \"What? Don't you like it? I heard that you don't like liveliness the most. The first few times I saw you, you were always enthusiastic.\" Can such an atmosphere be enthusiastic? Aren't you worried about indigestion? She smiled lightly and said casually, \"Gu Qianning's brain was flooded at that time.\" Gu Qianning heard a sneer escape Ji Jiangying's lips and teeth. After taking a step, he was thinking, what position does this Ji Jiangying occupy in Gu Qianning's heart? Based on the remaining fragments in her mind, she drew ten grids in her heart. Ji Jiangying and Ji Jiangran both have a large proportion in it, but Ji Jiangying is obviously more important. Gu Qianning couldn't figure out what he looked like, but she seemed to understand his temperament very well. He was cool and cold-blooded, and he was attracted to her. \"Why aren't you leaving? You can respond slowly, but your attitude must be positive.\" Ji Jiangran hooked her little finger with ease and went to the restaurant first. The meal was uneventful. They were all from well-off families, and almost no one spoke during the meal. After dinner, several juniors gathered around the two elders of the Ji family and sat in the living room. The servants had already brought fruits and tea. Gu Qianning and Ji Jiangying sat on one side, while Yan Ruyu and Ji Jiangran sat on the other side. Jian Bai was the first to speak; \"We have a plan. Considering that you are not too young, we might as well hold the wedding together so that the ceremony will not be small. I thought I would discuss it with you.\" No one said anything. Ji Mingyi asked Ji Jiangying: \"You don't have any objections, do you?\" Ji Jiangying said lazily: \"I don't have any objections, I'm just afraid that I don't have time.\" This is not the same as having no objections.", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}